                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 836/122.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Janes to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1909-01-17"><hi rendition="#italic">January 17,
                        1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Reports presidential decree signed 14th, which continues during 1909 tariff
                    reduction of 20 per cent, favoring articles enjoying privilege last year.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
